# text
seg-ebce9753f310 = Kshana is AGPL-3.0 with commercial editions. A source passes only if all hold:

# text
seg-78df1ece730d = Commercial use is allowed (no "non-commercial only", no "internal evaluation only").

# text
seg-b2bf29133d00 = Derived aggregate maps (per-cell, per-day counts and flags, no per-aircraft or per-vessel records) may be redistributed.

# text
seg-38c7743749a0 = The attribution obligation is one we can embed in every output file.

# text
seg-cee774fc4286 = Outputs of Kshana never contain per-aircraft or per-vessel identifiers (ICAO hex, MMSI, callsign, name). Aggregation is the only output form.

